OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cold but
OL,6,Fdry night with extensive clear spells
OL,7,Fallowing a frost to form, particularly
OL,8,Fin rural locations. Coastal spots
OL,9,Fcould still see the odd shower through
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAnother cold and frosty start,
OL,13,Fwith plenty of sunshine around.
OL,14,FRemaining dry overnight with extensive
OL,15,Fclear spells, allowing a frost to form.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
