OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAnother
OL,6,Fchilly, dry and sunny day follows on
OL,7,FSaturday, before conditions turn more
OL,8,Funsettled through Sunday into Monday
OL,9,Fas it becomes breezier with spells of
OL,10,Frain.
